<!--Grab the classname of the vehicle "variant" you want to spawn, and add it to the snippet below,
 you can also add attachments to the vehicle as well,
just make sure to match the colors of the attachments to the vehicle, 
if there is a red car, make sure to add red doors, red trunk/hood/backdoor, etc.-->
 
<!-- IF it matches the name of located in the types.xml.
 be sure to check for compatibility, you can not add mods, to other mods.lol DO NOT DO THIS!!!!!
 make sure to add all trunk/hood/door/wheels attachments for the vehicle to spawn with them.
 also remember that vehicles have a fixed storage compaciity, so do not over do it with attachments.-->
  
 
  <type name="classname of Vehicle /  EX: BMW_M3_Black">
		<attachments chance="1.00">
			<item name="classname_trunk/hood/backdoor/" chance="1.00" />
		</attachments>
		<attachments chance="1.00">
			<item name="classname_trunk/hood/backdoor/" chance="1.00" />
	</attachments>

